          "counted": null,
          "countedNote": null,
          "key": "Neutral oil"
        }
      ],
      "body": "Set the Instant Pot to Sauté (high) and add the oil. Sear the beef in 3 batches, turning once, until deeply browned on two sides. Don’t crowd the pot. Set aside."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [
        {
          "name": "Bay leaves",
          "g": null,
          "vol": "2",
