          "na": null,
          "pro": null,
          "counted": null,
          "countedNote": null,
          "key": "Bay leaves"
        }
      ],
      "body": "Add a splash of sauce and scrape up every browned bit (prevents the BURN warning). Return the beef and juices, pour over the rest of the sauce, tuck in the bay leaves."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Lock the lid, valve on Sealing. High pressure 70 min (other cuts: see table), then natural release ≥20 min. The beef should fall apart under a fork."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Remove the bay leaves. Shred the beef on the sheet pan with two forks. Skim the fat off the pot and toss the beef with ≈1 cup (240 g) of the juices. Broil on high until the edges are crisp, 4–6 min."
    },
